@page "/pricing"
@layout MarketingLayout

<PageTitle>Pricing — Brainy</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Simple pricing for a practical second brain. Start free, upgrade when your knowledge starts working for you." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="mkt-hero">
    <div class="mkt-wrap">
        <span class="mkt-eyebrow mkt-rise">Pricing</span>
        <h1 class="mkt-title mkt-rise mkt-d1" style="max-width: 14em; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);">
            Simple pricing for <em>serious thinkers</em>.
        </h1>
        <p class="mkt-lead mkt-rise mkt-d2" style="margin-top: 1.4rem;">
            Start free and build the habit. Upgrade when your second brain starts
            doing real work for you.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section">
    <div class="mkt-wrap">
        <div class="mkt-price-grid">
            <article class="mkt-price mkt-rise mkt-d2">
                <h3>Starter</h3>
                <p class="mkt-price__tagline">Build the capture habit.</p>
                <div class="mkt-price__amount">€0</div>
                <span class="mkt-price__period">forever</span>
                <ul>
                    <li>Unlimited notes &amp; capture</li>
                    <li>PARA organization &amp; tags</li>
                    <li>Inbox processing</li>
                    <li>3 active projects</li>
                    <li>Today screen &amp; tasks</li>
                    <li>Search across everything</li>
                </ul>
                <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn--ghost" href="/Account/Register">Start free</a>
            </article>

            <article class="mkt-price mkt-price--featured mkt-rise mkt-d3">
                <span class="mkt-price__flag">Most popular</span>
                <h3>Pro</h3>
                <p class="mkt-price__tagline">Your knowledge, working for you.</p>
                <div class="mkt-price__amount">€8</div>
                <span class="mkt-price__period">per month, billed yearly</span>
                <ul>
                    <li>Everything in Starter</li>
                    <li>Unlimited projects, areas &amp; goals</li>
                    <li>AI suggestions with provenance</li>
                    <li>Summaries &amp; action-item extraction</li>
                    <li>Outputs: posts, reports, briefs</li>
                    <li>Calendar &amp; planning views</li>
                    <li>Priority support</li>
                </ul>
                <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn--primary" href="/Account/Register">Go Pro</a>
            </article>

            <article class="mkt-price mkt-rise mkt-d4">
                <h3>Team</h3>
                <p class="mkt-price__tagline">A shared brain for your team.</p>
                <div class="mkt-price__amount">€14</div>
                <span class="mkt-price__period">per member, per month</span>
                <ul>
                    <li>Everything in Pro</li>
                    <li>Shared projects &amp; resources</li>
                    <li>Team knowledge search</li>
                    <li>Roles &amp; permissions</li>
                    <li>Centralized billing</li>
                    <li>Onboarding assistance</li>
                </ul>
                <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn--ghost" href="/Account/Register">Start a team</a>
            </article>
        </div>
        <p class="mkt-price-note">
            Prices exclude VAT. Yearly billing shown; monthly billing available at checkout.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="mkt-wrap">
        <div class="mkt-section__head" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center; max-width: 34em;">
            <span class="mkt-eyebrow" style="justify-content: center;">Questions</span>
            <h2 class="mkt-title">Fair questions, straight answers.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mkt-faq">
            <details>
                <summary>Do I need a credit card to start?</summary>
                <p>
                    No. Starter is free forever — no card, no trial countdown. Upgrade
                    only when Pro features would genuinely save you time.
                </p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Who owns my notes and data?</summary>
                <p>
                    You do. Your content is yours, scoped to your account, and never
                    used to train models. Archiving is reversible, and you can delete
                    your account and data at any time.
                </p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>How does the AI assistance work?</summary>
                <p>
                    AI suggests where notes belong, extracts action items, and drafts
                    summaries — always labeled as AI-generated, always with your original
                    preserved, and always with sources attached. It never invents facts
                    or references; when information is missing, it says so.
                </p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>What happens if I downgrade?</summary>
                <p>
                    Nothing is deleted. Your projects beyond the Starter limit become
                    read-only until you archive them or upgrade again — your knowledge
                    is never held hostage.
                </p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Is Brainy just another note-taking app?</summary>
                <p>
                    No. Notes are the input, not the point. Brainy is built on the PARA
                    method and the CODE workflow so that what you capture becomes
                    organized, distilled, and reused in real work — posts, reports,
                    decisions, and shipped projects.
                </p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-cta">
    <div class="mkt-wrap">
        <h2 class="mkt-title">The best time to start was <em>your last good idea</em>.</h2>
        <p>The second best time is now. Capture your first note in under a minute.</p>
        <div class="mkt-cta__actions">
            <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn--onDark" href="/Account/Register">Get started free</a>
            <a class="mkt-btn mkt-btn--ghost" href="/features">Explore the features</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
